# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Background {#background}"
msgstr "Contesto {#background}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A QCSC workflow runs a QPU and an HPC system as one machine.\n"
"[QCSC-Prefect](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qcsc-prefect) runs QCSC workflows on\n"
"[Prefect](https://www.prefect.io/) and keeps them traceable, configurable, and resumable.\n"
msgstr ""
"Un workflow QCSC fa funzionare una QPU e un sistema HPC come un'unica macchina.\n"
"[QCSC-Prefect](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qcsc-prefect) esegue workflow QCSC su\n"
"[Prefect](https://www.prefect.io/) e li mantiene tracciabili, configurabili e riprendibili.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This tutorial demonstrates these features with sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD) of the N$_2$ molecule. The [Quantum Resource Management Interface (QRMI)](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qrmi) samples the circuit inside a [Slurm](https://slurm.schedmd.com/) job. The\n"
"[Fulqrum](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-fulqrum) eigensolver diagonalizes the sampled\n"
"subspaces in more Slurm jobs. One [Prefect Cloud](https://www.prefect.io/cloud) deployment runs both.\n"
msgstr ""
"Questo tutorial mostra queste funzionalità con la diagonalizzazione quantistica basata su campioni (SQD) della molecola N$_2$. Il [Quantum Resource Management Interface (QRMI)](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qrmi) campiona il circuito all'interno di un job [Slurm](https://slurm.schedmd.com/). L'autosolutore\n"
"[Fulqrum](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-fulqrum) diagonalizza i sottospazi campionati\n"
"in altri job Slurm. Un solo deployment [Prefect Cloud](https://www.prefect.io/cloud) esegue entrambi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "QCSC-Prefect also runs large QCSC workloads, as in the following projects.\n"
msgstr "QCSC-Prefect esegue anche grandi carichi di lavoro QCSC, come nei progetti seguenti.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A study of protein-ligand complexes with more than 12,000 atoms used QCSC-Prefect. It\n"
"sampled quantum-embedding fragments on two 156-qubit IBM Quantum processors, with up to 94\n"
"qubits, and diagonalized the fragment subspaces on the Fugaku, Miyabi-G, and ROQUO\n"
"supercomputers [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr ""
"Uno studio di complessi proteina-ligando con più di 12.000 atomi ha usato QCSC-Prefect. Ha\n"
"campionato frammenti di quantum embedding su due processori IBM Quantum da 156 qubit, con fino a 94\n"
"qubit, e ha diagonalizzato i sottospazi dei frammenti sui supercomputer Fugaku, Miyabi-G e ROQUO\n"
"[\\[1\\]](#references).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A study of iron-sulfur clusters ran an extended QCSC-Prefect SQD workflow with 36 orbitals\n"
"(72 qubits) and subspace dimensions up to $3 \\times 10^{10}$ on the Fugaku, Miyabi, and\n"
"ROQUO supercomputers [\\[2\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr ""
"Uno studio di cluster ferro-zolfo ha eseguito un workflow SQD QCSC-Prefect esteso con 36 orbitali\n"
"(72 qubit) e dimensioni dei sottospazi fino a $3 \\times 10^{10}$ sui supercomputer Fugaku, Miyabi e\n"
"ROQUO [\\[2\\]](#references).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "The challenge of QCSC workflows {#the-challenge-of-qcsc-workflows}"
msgstr "La sfida dei workflow QCSC {#the-challenge-of-qcsc-workflows}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The SQD workflow is typical of QCSC workloads. QCSC-Prefect answers each of its challenges\n"
"with one feature, as in the following table.\n"
msgstr ""
"Il workflow SQD è tipico dei carichi di lavoro QCSC. QCSC-Prefect risponde a ciascuna delle sue sfide\n"
"con una funzionalità, come nella tabella seguente.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Challenge | QCSC-Prefect feature |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| It spans several resources. A Slurm job holds the QPU, then many Slurm jobs diagonalize subspaces, round after round. | Traceable workflow |\n"
"| It has many parameters at different levels (science, circuit, and cluster), and credentials must stay out of all of them. | Configurable parameters |\n"
"| It is long and can fail anywhere, from a walltime limit, a node failure, or a long QPU queue. Without care, a late failure means sampling on the QPU again. | Resumable execution |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Sfida | Funzionalità di QCSC-Prefect |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| Coinvolge più risorse. Un job Slurm tiene la QPU, poi molti job Slurm diagonalizzano i sottospazi, round dopo round. | Workflow tracciabile |\n"
"| Ha molti parametri a livelli diversi (scienza, circuito e cluster), e le credenziali devono restare fuori da tutti. | Parametri configurabili |\n"
"| È lungo e può fallire ovunque, per un limite di walltime, un guasto di un nodo o una lunga coda sulla QPU. Senza precauzioni, un fallimento tardivo significa campionare di nuovo sulla QPU. | Esecuzione riprendibile |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each step of [Qiskit Pattern in QCSC-Prefect step by step](#qiskit-pattern-in-qcsc-prefect-step-by-step) ends with a box that shows how QCSC-Prefect traces, configures, and resumes that stage.\n"
msgstr "Ogni passo di [Pattern Qiskit in QCSC-Prefect passo per passo](#qiskit-pattern-in-qcsc-prefect-step-by-step) termina con un riquadro che mostra come QCSC-Prefect traccia, configura e riprende quella fase.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Traceable workflow {#traceable-workflow}"
msgstr "Workflow tracciabile {#traceable-workflow}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A Prefect *flow* is a Python function made of *tasks*. QCSC-Prefect makes each stage of a\n"
"[Qiskit pattern](/guides/intro-to-patterns) (**Map**, **Optimize**, **Execute**, and **Postprocess**) one task. For every run, Prefect Cloud shows the following information:\n"
msgstr ""
"Un *flow* di Prefect è una funzione Python composta da *task*. QCSC-Prefect rende ogni fase di un\n"
"[pattern Qiskit](/guides/intro-to-patterns) (**Map**, **Optimize**, **Execute** e **Postprocess**) un task. Per ogni esecuzione, Prefect Cloud mostra le seguenti informazioni:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The task graph, with an arrow wherever one task passes its result to another.\n"
msgstr "Il grafo dei task, con una freccia ovunque un task passi il proprio risultato a un altro.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The state, inputs, logs, and duration of each task, filterable by the stage tags `map`, `optimize`, `execute`, and `post-process`.\n"
msgstr "Lo stato, gli input, i log e la durata di ogni task, filtrabili per i tag di fase `map`, `optimize`, `execute` e `post-process`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The *artifacts*, which are tables and links that tasks publish, such as the source of the\n"
"samples or the energy of each subspace.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gli *artefatti*, ovvero tabelle e link che i task pubblicano, come l'origine dei\n"
"campioni o l'energia di ciascun sottospazio.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The workflow host only submits and monitors work. The compute-intensive work runs as Slurm jobs, as in the following image.\n"
msgstr "L'host del workflow si limita a inviare e monitorare il lavoro. Il lavoro ad alta intensità di calcolo viene eseguito come job Slurm, come nell'immagine seguente.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
